# SemanticScript standard-library relay module.

module standard
purpose module standard "Top-level relay for the official SemanticScript standard-library modules."
moduleOwns standard "The `standard` namespace relay and explicit imports for each child `standard.*` module."
moduleDoesNotOwn standard "Child module implementation bodies, executable entry points, tests, or application build metadata."
invariant module standard "Each child module resolves through `std/<module>/main.sem`; this relay has no runtime entry operation."

exportConstant standard standardModuleVersionText
storage module immutable standardModuleVersionText CNullTerminatedByteString "standard 0.1"

